 "Em 2014 o SAM detectou compostos orgânicos em um pó de rocha coletado pela broca do Curiosity, numa rocha chamada “Cumberland”.": "In 2014 SAM detected organic compounds in rock powder drilled by Curiosity, from a rock called “Cumberland”.",
